nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">月之暗面计划于第三季度发布 Kimi K3 大模型，参数规模达 2.5 万亿</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI爬虫活动激增三倍，GPT-5应用阶段数据采集力度大幅提升</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Mistral AI发布企业级编排工具Workflows，支持Python开发与人工审批</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁集团正式开源百灵大模型Ling-2.6-flash，智效比提升十倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9ef76a49c544e7a9e940855ff5866329.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁集团正式开源百灵大模型Ling-2.6-flash，该模型总参数量为104B，激活参数为7.4B。为适配多样化硬件，官方同步提供BF16、FP8及INT4等多种量化版本。在技术架构上，该模型引入混合线性架构，在H20显卡环境下推理速度最高达340 Token/s。核心优势在于智效比，完成同等复杂任务时，其消耗的Token数量仅为同类模型的十分之一，显著降低企业运营成本。针对Agent应用场景，蚂蚁集团进行了定向增强，提升了模型在复杂工具调用与长路径任务规划中的逻辑执行力。目前，Ling-2.6-flash已在Hugging Face和ModelScope开源社区上线，旨在赋能垂直领域开发者，降低AI部署门槛并保障数据隐私。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布Nemotron 3 Nano Omni多模态模型，智能体推理效率提升九倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/62b9e13e0dbd0f3c9f62b9537b1ee823.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式发布开放式多模态模型Nemotron 3 Nano Omni，该模型将视频、音频、图像及文本推理能力整合至单一系统。技术架构上，模型采用30B-A3B混合专家架构，并集成视觉与音频编码器，无需额外感知模型支持。在性能表现方面，Nemotron 3 Nano Omni在复杂文档解析、视频及音频理解任务中表现优异，已在六大权威排行榜位居前列。官方数据显示，该模型AI系统吞吐量较同类产品提升9倍，能快速解读全高清屏幕录像，显著优化智能体与数字环境的交互效率。H Company首席执行官Gautier Cloix指出，该模型实现了此前难以达成的快速解读能力。目前，Nemotron 3系列模型累计下载量已突破5000万次，新模型已与多家企业系统展开协作，进一步巩固了英伟达在开放式多模态模型领域的效率标杆地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面计划于第三季度发布 Kimi K3 大模型，参数规模达 2.5 万亿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/771388504ca418bb53c19b1e1546d63c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">月之暗面计划于今年第三季度正式发布下一代主力模型 Kimi K3，该模型参数规模将达到 2.5 万亿，旨在通过算力与模型容量的提升，进一步拉高国产大模型的竞争门槛。在核心性能方面，Kimi K3 将延续并强化其长文本处理优势，上下文长度标准提升至约 100 万字，以支持更复杂的文档分析、代码库处理及大规模数据集交互。此次迭代紧随 4 月 21 日开源的 K2.6 版本之后，展现了月之暗面在工程落地与模型迭代上的紧凑节奏。此前，Kimi 系列已通过 K2.5 模型在开源榜单取得领先，并实现 1 亿美元的年经常性收入（ARR）。Kimi K3 的推出标志着国产大模型在万亿参数量级上的竞争进入白热化阶段，将直接影响行业在超长文本处理与复杂任务推理方面的技术标准。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI爬虫活动激增三倍，GPT-5应用阶段数据采集力度大幅提升</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8bcc90ae280ae1fccd3afc68edf3fc9b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">自2025年8月GPT-5发布并进入应用阶段以来，OpenAI在全球互联网的数据采集力度显著增强，旗下爬虫程序活跃度激增约300%。监测显示，专门用于实时检索的OAI-SearchBot日志事件数量已超越负责模型训练的GPTBot，标志着ChatGPT正将重心转向提供更具时效性的搜索反馈。OpenAI通过高频网络扫描，优化了新闻类查询与专业知识类需求的分类处理逻辑，在医疗、媒体及出版行业引发了明显的访问量增长。尽管OpenAI爬虫总量目前仅为谷歌的4%，但双方差距正快速缩小。对于内容产业而言，这一趋势迫使网站运营者在保护数据版权与获取AI搜索流量入口之间做出权衡，如何在AI技术迭代背景下平衡可见性已成为行业共同挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Mistral AI发布企业级编排工具Workflows，支持Python开发与人工审批</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bbabdbf13b0519714ed26a472df3379a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Mistral AI正式推出企业级AI编排工具Workflows，现已进入公开预览阶段。该工具作为Mistral Studio平台的核心组件，基于高性能Temporal引擎构建，支持开发人员使用Python定义复杂业务流程。Workflows引入了“人工在环”审核机制，仅需一行代码即可在关键节点暂停工作流以待人工审批，确保货物放行或数据检查等环节的合规性。在架构设计上，该工具实现了业务编排与敏感数据处理的分离，客户核心数据保留在自有系统内，员工可通过Le Chat机器人触发自动化序列。目前，ASML、ABANCA及CMA-CGM等跨国企业已将其应用于核心业务。此次发布补齐了Mistral AI从底层模型到应用编排的全栈能力，标志着其从简单的对话交互转向复杂任务自动化，将显著加速AI技术在严谨商业场景中的工程化落</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
